0..70 Comment "// Vector programs as they should read, and what refuses each of them."
71..73 Comment "//"
74..153 Comment "// A case on a vector binds each arm\'s index equation, prunes an arm whose ends"
154..232 Comment "// are apart, and solves an equation with a variable side. An equation between"
233..301 Comment "// two applications of one constructor stays unsolved. A binder of a"
302..368 Comment "// recursion\'s stage moves along its equation and keeps its stage."
369..371 Comment "//"
372..443 Comment "// The checker refuses each declaration below by the name its attribute"
444..522 Comment "// states. Each turns to `checks` as its rung lands, and the source then moves"
523..544 Comment "// to the model root."
545..547 Comment "//"
548..618 Comment "// - see: #3515 — not implemented: injectivity, for `tail` and `zip`"
619..692 Comment "// - see: #3516 — not implemented: an implicit under a constructor, for"
693..711 Comment "//   `firstOfPair`"
712..790 Comment "// - see: #3517 — not implemented: an implicit block on `def rec`, for `zip`"
791..846 Comment "// - see: #3481 — the spike that wrote these programs"
848..885 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
